{"id": "03", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "That night, you couldn't sleep. The talent show was in four days. [pause] So you went where you always go when real life gets scary."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Mega Obby. One thousand stages. [pause] You'd been climbing it for three months."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Four thousand, eight hundred and sixteen falls. [pause] And nobody laughed. Nobody even remembered. [pause] You just... respawned."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[sighs] I wish real life had checkpoints."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Two in the morning. Stage nine hundred and ninety-nine. [pause] One jump left."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[whispers, focused] Come on... come on... [pause] YES!"}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "[calm] Final checkpoint reached. [pause] Exporting... to real life."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[confused] Exporting to WHAT?"}, {"speaker": "TIP", "text": "[bubbly, fast] Hiii! Welcome to Real Life! I'm Tip, your tutorial! [pause] TIP: Step on the checkpoint to save your progress!"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[backing away] You're a... talking pop-up."}, {"speaker": "TIP", "text": "[proud] A HELPFUL talking pop-up!"}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "Checkpoint saved."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Gary saw the whole thing. [pause] Gary told no one."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 9.6, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 132, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 9.6, "end_time_seconds": 15.920000000000002, "character_start_index": 132, "character_end_index": 212, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 15.920000000000002, "end_time_seconds": 25.2, "character_start_index": 212, "character_end_index": 342, "dialogue_input_index": 2}, {"voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ", "start_time_second